     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "Please ensure form signed by HoS and Dean/HoD prior to forwarding to DVC or Director, International Services",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 305.81,
     "base": 315.65,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "Section 3:  Travel class other than economy class",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 356.56,
     "base": 367.25,
     "size": 12.0,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "Refer to the Travel Policy at: http://www.utas.edu.au/docs/fin_services/policies/policy_11-10.html",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 382.85,
     "base": 392.69,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "The University requires that all travel by air on official University business will be at economy class rates with",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 408.17,
     "base": 418.01,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "exceptions for Vice-Chancellor, Deputy Vice-Chancellor, Pro-Vice Chancellors, Executive Director Finance and",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 420.89,
     "base": 430.73,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "Administration, Deans of Faculty, Heads of Institutes, or staff at or above an equivalent level.  Other staff may seek",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 433.51,
     "base": 443.35,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "approval for travel class other than economy for a particular journey on a case by case basis, taking account of:",
     "x": 42.6,
     "y": 446.11,
     "base": 455.95,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 458.41,
     "base": 469.51,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the nature of the travel,",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 459.67,
     "base": 469.51,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
