     "y": 471.85,
     "base": 482.95,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the distance travelled,",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 473.11,
     "base": 482.95,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 485.29,
     "base": 496.39,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the pressure and nature of the business conducted,",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 486.55,
     "base": 496.39,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 498.73,
     "base": 509.83,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the frequency a staff member is required to travel internationally as part of their job,",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 499.99,
     "base": 509.83,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 512.17,
     "base": 523.27,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the complexity of the journey (eg where the travel itinerary is arduous),",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 513.43,
     "base": 523.27,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 525.61,
     "base": 536.71,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "the need for flexibility in the travel itinerary, and/or",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 526.87,
     "base": 536.71,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "•",
     "x": 60.62,
     "y": 539.05,
     "base": 550.15,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "SymbolMT"
    },
    {
     "text": "there are other unusual circumstances such as medical conditions.",
     "x": 78.62,
     "y": 540.31,
     "base": 550.15,
     "size": 11.04,
     "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    },
